    "During the launch promotion, Business Pro accounts may continue to display advertisements. FanGeo+ will be available in a future update." : {
      "comment" : "Footnote on the Business Pro subscription screen clarifying ads during launch promo and future FanGeo+ availability.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Während der Einführungsaktion können Business Pro-Konten weiterhin Werbung anzeigen. FanGeo+ wird in einem zukünftigen Update verfügbar sein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During the launch promotion, Business Pro accounts may continue to display advertisements. FanGeo+ will be available in a future update."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante la promoción de lanzamiento, las cuentas Business Pro pueden seguir mostrando anuncios. FanGeo+ estará disponible en una actualización futura."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendant la promotion de lancement, les comptes Business Pro peuvent continuer à afficher des publicités. FanGeo+ sera disponible dans une prochaine mise à jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante la promozione di lancio, gli account Business Pro potrebbero continuare a visualizzare annunci pubblicitari. FanGeo+ sarà disponibile in un aggiornamento futuro."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Während der Einführungsaktion können Business Pro-Konten weiterhin Werbung anzeigen. FanGeo+ wird in einem zukünftigen Update verfügbar sein."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W trakcie promocji na kontach Business Pro mogą w dalszym ciągu wyświetlać się reklamy. FanGeo+ będzie dostępne w przyszłej aktualizacji."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante a promoção de lançamento, as contas Business Pro poderão continuar exibindo anúncios. FanGeo+ estará disponível em uma atualização futura."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Во время акции по запуску аккаунты Business Pro могут продолжать показывать рекламу. FanGeo+ будет доступен в будущем обновлении."
          }
        },
        "sq" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gjatë promovimit të nisjes, llogaritë Business Pro mund të vazhdojnë të shfaqin reklama. FanGeo+ do të jetë i disponueshëm në një përditësim të ardhshëm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在启动促销期间，Business Pro 帐户可能会继续显示广告。 FanGeo+ 将在未来的更新中提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
